OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power and
OL,4,Aflights cancelled as Storm Austen
OL,5,Alashes south-west England and the
OL,6,AChannel Islands
OL,7,
OL,8,FNearly 7,000 homes in Cornwall and
OL,9,FDevon are currently without power as
OL,10,FStorm Austen sweeps across parts of the
OL,11,FUK
OL,13,FGreat Western Railway (GWR) says speed
OL,14,Flimits will be in place on routes
OL,15,Fbetween Devon and Cornwall until 13:00
OL,16,FBST and flights to and from Exeter
OL,17,FAirport have been cancelled
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
