OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power and
OL,4,Aflights cancelled as Storm Austen
OL,5,Alashes south-west England and the
OL,6,AChannel Islands
OL,7,
OL,8,FThe Met Office has issued an amber
OL,9,Fweather warning for strong winds for
OL,10,FCornwall and parts of Devon. Meanwhile,
OL,11,Fa red warning is in place for Guernsey
OL,12,Fand Jersey
OL,14,FA further yellow weather warning for
OL,15,Fwind is kicking in from 10:00 for
OL,16,Fmillions across the South East and
OL,17,FNorth West of England, East Midlands
OL,18,Fand Wales
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
