OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power and
OL,4,Aflights cancelled as Storm Austen
OL,5,Alashes south-west England and the
OL,6,AChannel Islands
OL,7,
OL,8,FAll schools in Jersey have been told to
OL,9,Fclose on Friday. A number of schools
OL,10,Fare also closed or opening late in
OL,11,FCornwall
OL,13,FDevon County Council is urging people
OL,14,Fto postpone non-essential journeys
OL,15,Fwhile in Cornwall locals report
OL,16,Fdisruptions due to fallen trees and
OL,17,Fpower lines
